     </footer>\n      </blockquote>\n      </div>\n    <img src=\"/site/assets/files/2092/banner.jpg\" alt=\"citat\">\n    <img src=\"/site/templates/styles/images/overlay.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-6 w-3/4 mx-auto\">\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 justify-items-start my-6\">\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"prose mb-6\">\n                <h1 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-2xl\">Belokranjec, julij/avgust 2026, številka 7-8, letnik XXIX</h1>\n\n                                <div class=\"rounded-lg\">\n                    <img src=\"/site/assets/files/2177/belokranjec_avgust_2026.330x0.jpg\" width=\"330\" height=\"459\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-lg\" loading=\"lazy\">                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-row items-end justify-center space-x-2 group mb-6\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"size-8 group-hover:fill-bk\">\n                    <path d=\"M465.78 321.509H315.56V99.015a7.497 7.497 0 0 0-2.218-5.324L221.104 2.176A7.588 7.588 0 0 0 215.822 0H23.485C14.223 0 6.689 7.519 6.689 16.761V68c0 9.386 15 9.813 15 0V16.761c0-.971.806-1.761 1.796-1.761h184.837v75.354c0 9.242 7.535 16.761 16.797 16.761h75.44v214.394h-52.706c-21.798 0-39.532 17.733-39.532 39.531v51.507H23.485c-.991 0-1.796-.79-1.796-1.761V105c0-9.386-15-9.813-15 0v305.786c0 9.242 7.535 16.761 16.796 16.761h184.837v44.922c0 21.798 17.734 39.531 39.532 39.531h171.558c9.386 0 9.813-15 0-15H247.854c-13.527 0-24.532-11.005-24.532-24.531V361.04c0-13.526 11.005-24.531 24.532-24.531H465.78c13.527 0 24.532 11.005 24.532 24.531v111.429c0 13.526-11.005 24.531-24.532 24.531h-7.465c-9.386 0-9.813 15 0 15h7.465c21.798 0 39.532-17.733 39.532-39.531V361.04c-.001-21.798-17.735-39.531-39.532-39.531zM225.119 92.115c-.991 0-1.797-.79-1.797-1.761V25.59l66.614 66.525z\"></path>\n                    <path d=\"M454.5 423.129c9.386 0 9.813-15 0-15h-24.402v-26.941h27